        "@value": "Come One Come All Vol. 2 | Eveningstarmusic"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Public Choir Night at Moondog Cafe is having its Second volume hosted by Evening Star! Come on in and make a new friend as we lead everybody in 3 part harmony! \nDoors at 6 Music at 6:30\nSelections for this edition will be: Love's in Need of Love, and Ain't Nobody"
